"Nilvera, a certified private integrator, which securely stores the data on "
"servers located in Türkiye in accordance with Turkish e-invoicing and data "
"retention requirements. This ensures invoices remain accessible for "
"retrieval, audits, and legal compliance purposes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/turkiye.rst:38
