#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:3
msgid "Consolidation"
msgstr "Консолидация"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:5
msgid ""
"Consolidation allows combining financial data from **multiple separate "
"companies**, each with its own books, into a unified view, providing a "
"\"fair image\" of the entire group's financial health."
msgstr ""
"Консолидация позволяет объединить финансовые данные из **нескольких "
"отдельных компаний**, каждая из которых ведёт собственный учёт, в единое "
"представление, обеспечивая «объективную картину» финансового состояния всей "
"группы."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:8
msgid ""
"It helps create a clear, comprehensive view of the group's financial "
"performance by combining data from multiple companies."
msgstr ""
"Это помогает создать чёткое, комплексное представление о финансовых "
"результатах группы путём объединения данных из нескольких компаний."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:12
msgid ""
"Consolidating companies involves **legally separate entities**, "
"whereas :ref:`branches <general/branches>` are **subdivisions** of a single "
"legal entity which often share the head office's resources (journals, taxes, "
"accounts, fiscal positions) and are not consolidated in the same way."
msgstr ""
"Консолидация компаний включает **юридически отдельные организации**, в то "
"время как :ref:`филиалы <general/branches>` являются **подразделениями** "
"единой юридической организации, которые часто используют общие ресурсы "
"головного офиса (журналы, налоги, счета, фискальные позиции) и не "
"консолидируются таким же образом."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:20
msgid "Consolidation tools"
msgstr "Инструменты консолидации"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:22
msgid ""
"**Several tools** combined together will contribute to the construction of "
"the financial consolidation:"
msgstr ""
"**Несколько инструментов**, используемых вместе, способствуют построению "
"финансовой консолидации:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:27
msgid ""
"**Account Mapping:** Similar accounts from different companies can be mapped "
"together. This allows Odoo to combine them correctly in consolidated "
"reports. To map accounts, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration "
"--> Chart of Accounts`.  Click :guilabel:`View` on the account line. In "
"the :guilabel:`Mapping` tab, enter a code in the corresponding "
"company :guilabel:`Code` column to map the account."
msgstr ""
"**Сопоставление счетов:** Похожие счета из разных компаний могут быть "
"сопоставлены друг с другом. Это позволяет Odoo правильно объединять их в "
"консолидированных отчётах. Чтобы сопоставить счета, перейдите "
"в :menuselection:`Бухгалтерский учёт --> Настройка --> План счетов`. "
"Нажмите :guilabel:`Просмотреть` на строке счёта. На "
"вкладке :guilabel:`Сопоставление` введите код в соответствующем "
"столбце :guilabel:`Код` компании, чтобы сопоставить счёт."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:None
msgid "Mapping different codes to different companies."
msgstr "Сопоставление разных кодов разным компаниям."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:36
msgid ""
":ref:`Import mapping <consolidation_import_account_mapping>` or merge "
"existing accounts using the :ref:`merging tool <consolidation_merge_tool>` "
"can simplify the process."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Импорт сопоставления <consolidation_import_account_mapping>` или "
"объединение существующих счетов с помощью :ref:`инструмента объединения "
"<consolidation_merge_tool>` может упростить процесс."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:39
msgid ""
"When multiple accounts from one company are mapped to a single account in "
"another, it is then possible to group the multiple accounts into a single "
"line in the other company's reporting by :ref:`grouping by <customize-"
"reports/lines-group-by>` the *account code* (`account_code`) rather than the "
"*account ID* (`account_id`)."
msgstr ""
"Когда несколько счетов из одной компании сопоставлены с одним счётом в "
"другой, можно затем сгруппировать несколько счетов в одну строку в "
"отчётности другой компании, выполнив :ref:`группировку по <customize-reports/"
"lines-group-by>` *коду счёта* (`account_code`), а не по *ID счёта* "
"(`account_id`)."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:45
msgid ""
"Some reports, such as the :ref:`profit and loss <accounting/reporting/profit-"
"and-loss>`, split the lines into different sections by account type. When "
"these reports are grouped by account code, the section splits are "
"maintained, but within each section, line grouping by account code is "
"respected."
msgstr ""
"Некоторые отчёты, такие как :ref:`отчёт о прибылях и убытках <accounting/"
"reporting/profit-and-loss>`, разделяют строки на разные разделы по типу "
"счёта. Когда эти отчёты группируются по коду счёта, разделение на разделы "
"сохраняется, но внутри каждого раздела соблюдается группировка строк по коду "
"счёта."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:51
msgid ""
"Belgian Company is a parent company with a subsidiary, American Company. "
"American Company has five income accounts:"
msgstr ""
"Belgian Company является материнской компанией с дочерней компанией American "
"Company. У American Company есть пять счетов доходов:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:54
msgid "400000 Product Sales - Domestic"
msgstr "400000 Продажи продукции - внутренние"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:55
msgid "400100 Product Sales - International"
msgstr "400100 Продажи продукции - международные"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:56
msgid "410000 Service Revenue - Consulting"
msgstr "410000 Доход от услуг - консалтинг"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:57
msgid "420000 Subscription Revenue"
msgstr "420000 Доход от подписок"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:58
msgid "430000 Freight & Handling Revenue"
msgstr "430000 Доход от перевозки и обработки"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:60
msgid ""
"All five of the US income accounts correspond to one single income account "
"(700000 Income) in the Belgian Company."
msgstr ""
"Все пять счетов доходов США соответствуют одному единственному счету доходов "
"(700000 Доход) в Belgian Company."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:63
msgid ""
"For the Belgian Company's profit and loss report to show one line for all of "
"the American Company's combined income accounts related to the Belgian "
"Company's single income account, all five income accounts from the American "
"Company must be mapped to The Belgian Company's 700000 Income account, and "
"the report's lines must be :ref:`grouped by <customize-reports/lines-group-"
"by>` the account code."
msgstr ""
"Чтобы отчёт о прибылях и убытках Belgian Company показывал одну строку для "
"всех объединённых счетов доходов American Company, связанных с единственным "
"счетом доходов Belgian Company, все пять счетов доходов American Company "
"должны быть сопоставлены со счётом 700000 Доход Belgian Company, а строки "
"отчёта должны быть :ref:`сгруппированы по <customize-reports/lines-group-"
"by>` коду счёта."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:71
msgid ""
"**Multi-Ledgers:** Ledgers are fundamental to the process of consolidation. "
"They are either:"
msgstr ""
"**Множественные регистры:** Регистры являются основой процесса консолидации. "
"Они бывают:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:73
msgid ""
"*Regular Ledgers:* Each company in the consolidation scope has its own "
"standard accounting ledger where all the regular day-to-day transactions are "
"recorded. It excludes the company's consolidation adjustment journals."
msgstr ""
"*Обычные регистры:* У каждой компании в области консолидации есть свой "
"стандартный бухгалтерский регистр, где записываются все обычные повседневные "
"транзакции. Он исключает журналы корректировок консолидации компании."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:77
msgid ""
"*Multi-Ledger for Consolidation:* The company doing the actual consolidation "
"also has a special multi-ledger. This one includes all the other companies' "
"consolidation adjustments journals (the ones excluded from their own "
"ledgers). This allows for viewing the total impact of all the adjustments."
msgstr ""
"*Множественный регистр для консолидации:* У компании, выполняющей "
"фактическую консолидацию, также есть специальный множественный регистр. Он "
"включает журналы корректировок консолидации всех других компаний (те, "
"которые исключены из их собственных регистров). Это позволяет просматривать "
"общее влияние всех корректировок."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:82
msgid ""
"To create a new ledger, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --"
"> Multi-Ledgers` and hit the :guilabel:`New` button. Enter a name, pick the "
"company the ledger is linked to and most importantly, determine which "
"journals are to be excluded from the ledger."
msgstr ""
"Чтобы создать новый регистр, перейдите в :menuselection:`Бухгалтерский учёт "
"--> Настройка --> Множественные регистры` и нажмите "
"кнопку :guilabel:`Создать`. Введите название, выберите компанию, с которой "
"связан регистр, и, что наиболее важно, определите, какие журналы должны быть "
"исключены из регистра."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:91
msgid ""
"**Multi-Company Selector:** The consolidated view can be accessed using the "
"multi-company"
msgstr ""
"**Селектор нескольких компаний:** Доступ к консолидированному представлению "
"можно получить с помощью селектора нескольких компаний."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:89
msgid ""
"selector. Selecting the consolidating company as the current company and "
"making the other companies visible in the selector, all the journal items "
"are displayed from the consolidating company's perspective."
msgstr ""
"Выбрав консолидирующую компанию в качестве текущей компании и сделав другие "
"компании видимыми в селекторе, все проводки журнала отображаются с точки "
"зрения консолидирующей компании."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:None
msgid "Selecting the main company and activating others."
msgstr "Выбор основной компании и активация других."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:111
msgid ""
"**Horizontal Groups:** Odoo's reporting tools allow for combining multi-"
"ledgers and using"
msgstr ""
"**Горизонтальные группы:** Инструменты отчётности Odoo позволяют объединять "
"множественные регистры и использовать"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:99
msgid ""
"horizontal groups to view the consolidated Balance Sheet or P&L. They also "
"show how much each company contributes to the overall consolidated figures."
msgstr ""
"горизонтальные группы для просмотра консолидированного баланса или отчёта о "
"прибылях и убытках. Они также показывают, какой вклад вносит каждая компания "
"в общие консолидированные показатели."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:102
msgid "Follow these steps to create an :guilabel:`Horizontal Group`:"
msgstr ""
"Выполните следующие шаги для создания :guilabel:`Горизонтальной группы`:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:105
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Horizontal Groups` "
"and click :guilabel:`New`."
msgstr ""
"Перейдите в :menuselection:`Бухгалтерский учёт --> Настройка --> "
"Горизонтальные группы` и нажмите :guilabel:`Создать`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:107
msgid ""
"Add a :guilabel:`Group Name` and select the :guilabel:`Reports` where the "
"horizontal group can be used."
msgstr ""
"Добавьте :guilabel:`Название группы` и выберите :guilabel:`Отчёты`, в "
"которых можно использовать горизонтальную группу."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:109
msgid "In the :guilabel:`Field` column, click :guilabel:`Add a line`."
msgstr "В столбце :guilabel:`Поле` нажмите :guilabel:`Добавить строку`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:110
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Create rules` window, add a :guilabel:`Field` and create a "
"new :guilabel:`Domain` rule if needed. Then, click :guilabel:`Save & Close`."
msgstr ""
"В окне :guilabel:`Создать правила` добавьте :guilabel:`Поле` и при "
"необходимости создайте новое правило :guilabel:`Домен`. Затем "
"нажмите :guilabel:`Сохранить и закрыть`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:None
msgid "Using horizontal groups to see each company's contribution."
msgstr ""
"Использование горизонтальных групп для просмотра вклада каждой компании."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:117
msgid ""
"When opened, financial reports usually default to a statutory view, using "
"the company's regular ledger (including its consolidation adjustment). To "
"see the full consolidation picture, **make sure to select the multi-ledger** "
"that includes all the consolidation adjustments."
msgstr ""
"При открытии финансовые отчеты обычно по умолчанию показывают установленное "
"законом представление, используя обычную главную книгу компании (включая её "
"корректировку консолидации). Чтобы увидеть полную картину консолидации, "
"**убедитесь, что выбрана многокнижная система**, включающая все "
"корректировки консолидации."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:123
msgid ""
"**Cumulative Translation Adjustments:** When consolidating companies with "
"different currencies, Odoo handles the translation."
msgstr ""
"**Накопленные корректировки пересчета:** При консолидации компаний с разными "
"валютами Odoo обрабатывает пересчет."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:126
msgid "Equity accounts: Use the historical exchange rate."
msgstr "Счета капитала: Используйте исторический обменный курс."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:128
msgid ""
"Profit and loss (P&L) accounts (including :ref:`appropriation accounts "
"<accounting/year-end/appropriation>`): Use the weighted average exchange "
"rate."
msgstr ""
"Счета прибылей и убытков (включая :ref:`счета распределения <accounting/year-"
"end/appropriation>`): Используйте средневзвешенный обменный курс."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:131
msgid ""
"Balance sheet accounts (excluding equity): Use the closing exchange rate."
msgstr ""
"Счета баланса (за исключением капитала): Используйте закрывающий обменный "
"курс."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:134
msgid "The rates used are those of the company currently selected."
msgstr "Используются курсы компании, выбранной в данный момент."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:139
msgid "Account merging"
msgstr "Объединение счетов"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:141
msgid ""
"Accounts can be merged to reduce the number of accounts and standardize them "
"across companies. This is optional; consolidation works without it."
msgstr ""
"Счета можно объединять для сокращения их количества и стандартизации между "
"компаниями. Это необязательно; консолидация работает и без этого."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:144
msgid ""
"To use the merge tool, select all the companies with an account that needs "
"to be merged in the company selector in the top right corner of the screen."
msgstr ""
"Чтобы использовать инструмент объединения, выберите все компании со счетом, "
"который нужно объединить, в селекторе компаний в правом верхнем углу экрана."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:None
msgid "Selecting all companies that have accounts to be merged."
msgstr "Выбор всех компаний, имеющих счета для объединения."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:150
msgid ""
"Then, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Chart of "
"Accounts` and select the accounts to merge. Click the :icon:`fa-"
"cog` :guilabel:`Actions` menu and select :guilabel:`Merge accounts`."
msgstr ""
"Затем перейдите в :menuselection:`Бухгалтерский учёт --> Настройка --> План "
"счетов` и выберите счета для объединения. Нажмите меню :icon:`fa-"
"cog` :guilabel:`Действия` и выберите :guilabel:`Объединить счета`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:154
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Merge accounts` window, enable the :guilabel:`Group by "
"name?` option if needed and click :guilabel:`Merge`."
msgstr ""
"В окне :guilabel:`Объединить счета` при необходимости включите "
"опцию :guilabel:`Группировать по названию?` и нажмите :guilabel:`Объединить`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:157
msgid ""
"The selected accounts are then merged into a single shared account, "
"accessible by all the chosen companies, just as if the account had been "
"directly created to be shared."
msgstr ""
"Выбранные счета затем объединяются в единый общий счет, доступный всем "
"выбранным компаниям, как если бы этот счет был создан изначально как общий."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:163
msgid "Account unmerging"
msgstr "Разделение счетов"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:165
msgid "Accounts can also be unmerged if needed."
msgstr "Счета также можно разделять при необходимости."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:169
msgid ""
"Note that unmerging accounts **will not unmerge the chatters** of the "
"accounts. Once merged, the changes' histories are permanently merged."
msgstr ""
"Обратите внимание, что разделение счетов **не разделит обсуждения** счетов. "
"После объединения истории изменений объединяются навсегда."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:172
msgid ""
"To unmerge accounts, select a company with a shared account in the company "
"selector at the top right corner of the screen. Then, go "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Chart of Accounts` and "
"select the account to unmerge. Click the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`Actions` "
"menu and select :guilabel:`Unmerge accounts`."
msgstr ""
"Чтобы разделить счета, выберите компанию с общим счетом в селекторе компаний "
"в правом верхнем углу экрана. Затем перейдите "
"в :menuselection:`Бухгалтерский учёт --> Настройка --> План счетов` и "
"выберите счет для разделения. Нажмите меню :icon:`fa-"
"cog` :guilabel:`Действия` и выберите :guilabel:`Разделить счета`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:177
msgid ""
"An :guilabel:`Odoo Warning` confirmation pop-up window will appear, listing "
"how the accounts will be split."
msgstr ""
"Появится всплывающее окно подтверждения :guilabel:`Предупреждение Odoo` со "
"списком того, как будут разделены счета."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:None
msgid ""
"Confirmation wizard for the Unmerge Tool of the shared accounts feature."
msgstr "Мастер подтверждения для инструмента разделения функции общих счетов."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:183
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Unmerge`. A new account linked to each company will be "
"created for the previously shared account."
msgstr ""
"Нажмите :guilabel:`Разделить`. Для ранее общего счета будет создан новый "
"счет, связанный с каждой компанией."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:189
msgid "Import a mapping"
msgstr "Импорт соответствия"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:191
msgid ""
"To **import an account mapping**, select all the related companies in the "
"company selector at the top right corner of the screen and go "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Chart of Accounts`."
msgstr ""
"Чтобы **импортировать соответствие счетов**, выберите все связанные компании "
"в селекторе компаний в правом верхнем углу экрана и перейдите "
"в :menuselection:`Бухгалтерский учёт --> Настройка --> План счетов`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:195
msgid ""
"First, to choose the fields to export, select the accounts, click "
"the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`Actions` button and select :guilabel:`Export`. "
"Then, in the :guilabel:`Export data` window, add the :guilabel:`Code mapping/"
"Code`, :guilabel:`Code Mapping/Company` and :guilabel:`External ID` fields "
"using the :icon:`fa-plus` icon and click :guilabel:`Export`. No other field "
"is required."
msgstr ""
"Во-первых, чтобы выбрать поля для экспорта, выберите счета, нажмите "
"кнопку :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`Действия` и выберите :guilabel:`Экспорт`. "
"Затем в окне :guilabel:`Экспорт данных` добавьте "
"поля :guilabel:`Соответствие кода/Код`, :guilabel:`Соответствие кода/"
"Компания` и :guilabel:`Внешний ID`, используя значок :icon:`fa-plus`, и "
"нажмите :guilabel:`Экспорт`. Другие поля не требуются."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:201
msgid ""
"Second, rework it in a spreadsheet adding the desired code for each company "
"on desired accounts."
msgstr ""
"Во-вторых, доработайте его в электронной таблице, добавив нужный код для "
"каждой компании по нужным счетам."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:203
msgid ""
"Third, to reimport the file (xlsx or csv format) in Odoo, "
"click :guilabel:`Import` and, in the :guilabel:`Import Chart of Accounts` "
"section, click :guilabel:`Import CoA`. In the :guilabel:`Accounting Import "
"Guide`, drop or click :guilabel:`Upload Data File` to import the file. Then, "
"click :guilabel:`Import`."
msgstr ""
"В-третьих, чтобы повторно импортировать файл (в формате xlsx или csv) в "
"Odoo, нажмите :guilabel:`Импорт` и в разделе :guilabel:`Импорт плана счетов` "
"нажмите :guilabel:`Импорт плана счетов`. В :guilabel:`Руководстве по импорту "
"бухгалтерского учёта` перетащите или нажмите :guilabel:`Загрузить файл "
"данных`, чтобы импортировать файл. Затем нажмите :guilabel:`Импорт`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:208
msgid ""
"Finally, the codes now take into account the mapping company per company."
msgstr "Наконец, коды теперь учитывают соответствие для каждой компании."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:7
msgid ""
"A company's inventory valuation should include all stock on hand. Accurately "
"recording this value in the accounting records ensures a true representation "
"of the company's current asset value."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:10
msgid ""
"The :doc:`Inventory <../../../inventory_and_mrp/inventory>` app maintains "
"real-time stock valuation based on physical item movement. In contrast, the "
"Accounting app updates accounting inventory valuation only when specifically "
"requested, most often for closing or (when using perpetual accounting) when "
"vendor bills or customer invoices are posted."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:16
msgid ""
"Use the :doc:`../../../inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/"
"cheat_sheet` for guidance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:21
msgid "Accounting standards"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:23
msgid ""
"In accounting, the timing of inventory expense recognition and its impact "
"on :ref:`journal entries <accounting-entries>` differ based on the "
"accounting standard used:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:26
msgid ""
"**Continental** accounting: the cost of goods is recorded as an expense when "
"the vendor bill is posted, typically upon receipt into stock, regardless of "
"when the goods are sold."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:28
msgid ""
"**Anglo-Saxon** accounting: the cost of goods sold (COGS) is recognized as "
"an expense when the customer invoice is posted, typically when products are "
"sold."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:36
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings`, then "
"scroll to the :guilabel:`Inventory Valuation` section to set the following "
"company-level options:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:39
msgid ""
":ref:`Inventory Valuation <accounting/inventory-valuation/valuation-"
"method>`: Set the valuation method as :guilabel:`Perpetual (at invoicing)` "
"or :guilabel:`Periodic (at closing)`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:41
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Periodic Valuation`: Set the :ref:`closing entry <accounting/"
"inventory-valuation/closing-entry>` process "
"to :guilabel:`Manual`, :guilabel:`Daily`, or :guilabel:`Monthly` to automate "
"it, if needed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:44
msgid ""
":ref:`Inventory Cost Method <costing-methods>`: Choose :guilabel:`Standard "
"Price`, :guilabel:`First in First Out (FIFO)`, or :guilabel:`Average Cost "
"(AVCO)`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:46
msgid ""
":ref:`Valuation Account <accounting/inventory-valuation/valuation-account>`: "
"Set the asset account used to record the financial value of physical stock. "
"Then, click the :icon:`oi-arrow-right` :guilabel:`(internal link)` next to "
"the :guilabel:`Valuation Account` field to open the :guilabel:`Stock "
"Valuation` account and update the :ref:`Variation Account <accounting/"
"inventory-valuation/variation-account>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:51
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Journal`: Set the journal to post inventory valuation entries in."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:52
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Other accounts can be defined on \"Inventory Loss\" and "
"\"Production\" on dedicated locations`: If needed, "
"click :guilabel:`locations` and set the :ref:`Inventory Loss <accounting/"
"inventory-valuation/inventory-loss>` or the :ref:`Cost of Production "
"<accounting/inventory-valuation/cost-of-production>` accounts."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:58
msgid ""
"Default accounts, inventory valuation methods, and costing methods can be "
"overridden by setting them on the product category form."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:64
msgid "Valuation methods"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:66
msgid ""
"The timing and manner of maintaining inventory records vary based on the "
"inventory valuation method:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:68
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Periodic (at closing)`: Inventory valuation is updated only when "
"generating entries during the :ref:`stock closing process <accounting/"
"inventory-valuation/closing-entry>`. While inventory movements are tracked "
"physically via the :doc:`Inventory Stock <../../../inventory_and_mrp/"
"inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/stock>` report, they are not "
"automatically synchronized with financial records. When using "
"the :guilabel:`Periodic` inventory valuation method, the expense account is "
"debited when vendor bills are posted."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:74
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Perpetual (at invoicing)`: Inventory valuation is updated when "
"bills or invoices are posted. The expense account (:abbr:`COGS (Cost of "
"goods sold)`) is debited when invoices are posted. Combined with "
"the :ref:`stock closing process <accounting/inventory-valuation/closing-"
"entry>`, :guilabel:`Perpetual (at invoicing)` inventory valuation is updated "
"for deliveries and receipts, even if there is no invoice or vendor bill yet."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:81
msgid ""
"The periodic valuation method is often associated with Continental "
"standards, while the perpetual method is commonly used with Anglo-Saxon "
"standards. However, companies may choose a different inventory valuation "
"method based on their specific needs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:84
msgid ""
"In :guilabel:`Perpetual` valuation, it is more common to set "
"the :guilabel:`Periodic Valuation` to :guilabel:`Manual` and generate "
"closing entries only when a fiscal period closes, or when accounting reports "
"require synchronization with inventory stock, unless an automatic update of "
"accounting inventory value is needed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:90
msgid ""
"When using the :guilabel:`Perpetual (at invoicing)` valuation method with "
"the :guilabel:`Standard Price` costing method, a :guilabel:`Price Difference "
"Account` can be set for the :guilabel:`Product Category`. This account "
"records the difference between the product's standard price, as specified on "
"the product form, and the actual billed price, helping track pricing "
"fluctuations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:99
msgid "Valuation account"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:101
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Valuation account` records the inventory value listed as a "
"current asset on the balance sheet. The :guilabel:`Valuation Account` tracks "
"inventory asset value differently depending on the selected :ref:`valuation "
"method <accounting/inventory-valuation/valuation-method>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:108
msgid "Variation account"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:110
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Variation account` is used to record inventory variations for "
"the period covered by the :ref:`stock closing process <accounting/inventory-"
"valuation/closing-entry>` and can be updated during :ref:`configuration "
"<accounting/inventory-valuation/configuration>`:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:114
msgid ""
"Continental :guilabel:`Periodic (at closing)`: Expense account (specific for "
"variation recording)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:115
msgid ""
"Anglo-Saxon :guilabel:`Perpetual (at invoicing)`: Current asset account "
"(recommended for interim tracking) or expense account (optional)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:119
msgid ""
"Stock variations resulting from product receipts and deliveries are "
"displayed in the :guilabel:`Stock Variation` section of the :ref:`Inventory "
"Valuation report <accounting/inventory-valuation/inventory-valuation-"
"report>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:122
msgid ""
"When using the :guilabel:`Perpetual (at invoicing)` inventory valuation, if "
"no bill or invoice has been posted for these moves yet, it allows their "
"impact on inventory value to be recorded in the accounting. "
"The :guilabel:`Variation account` serves as a buffer account until "
"the :ref:`accrual entries <accounting/inventory-valuation/accrual-entries>` "
"are recorded."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:131
msgid "Other accounts"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:136
msgid "Inventory Loss"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:138
msgid ""
"To exclude :doc:`inventory adjustments <../../../inventory_and_mrp/inventory/"
"warehouses_storage/inventory_management/count_products>` from "
"the :guilabel:`Variation account` at closing, configure "
"an :guilabel:`Inventory Adjustment` location account (:guilabel:`Inventory "
"Loss` location type) appropriately:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:143
#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:170
msgid ""
"In the :ref:`Inventory Valuation section of the Accounting settings "
"<accounting/inventory-valuation/configuration>`, click :guilabel:`locations` "
"in :guilabel:`Other accounts can be defined on \"Inventory Loss\" and "
"\"Production\" on dedicated locations`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:147
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Locations` list view, open any locations with "
"the :guilabel:`Inventory Loss` location type."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:149
msgid ""
"Set the :guilabel:`Loss Account` in the :guilabel:`Accounting` information "
"section."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:152
msgid ""
"When using the Continental accounting standard in combination with "
"the :guilabel:`Periodic (at closing)` valuation method, the update is "
"displayed in the :guilabel:`Inventory Loss` section of the :ref:`Inventory "
"Valuation report <accounting/inventory-valuation/inventory-valuation-"
"report>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:156
msgid ""
"When using the Anglo-Saxon accounting standard in combination with "
"the :guilabel:`Perpetual (at invoicing)` valuation method, "
"the :ref:`valuation account <accounting/inventory-valuation/valuation-"
"account>` updates immediately in real time once the move is completed."
msgstr ""

