"journal entry to maintain accurate inventory values after migration. This "
"rebalancing can be performed :ref:`before <accounting/inventory-valuation/"
"upgrade-process-server-action>` or :ref:`after <accounting/inventory-"
"valuation/upgrade-process-manual>` upgrading to Odoo 19."
