#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:7
msgid ""
"In Odoo, payments can either be automatically linked to an invoice or bill "
"or be stand-alone records for use at a later date:"
msgstr ""
"В Odoo платежи могут быть либо автоматически связаны со счётом или счётом-"
"фактурой, либо быть отдельными записями для использования в будущем:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:10
msgid ""
"If a payment is **linked to an invoice or bill**, it reduces/settles the "
"amount due on the invoice. Multiple payments on the same invoice are "
"possible."
msgstr ""
"Если платёж **связан со счётом или счётом-фактурой**, он уменьшает/погашает "
"сумму задолженности по счёту. Возможны несколько платежей по одному счёту."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:13
msgid ""
"If a payment is **not linked to an invoice or bill**, the customer has an "
"outstanding credit with the company, or the company has an outstanding debit "
"with a vendor. Those outstanding amounts reduce/settle unpaid invoices/bills."
msgstr ""
"Если платёж **не связан со счётом или счётом-фактурой**, у клиента есть "
"непогашенный кредит в компании, или у компании есть непогашенный дебет с "
"поставщиком. Эти непогашенные суммы уменьшают/погашают неоплаченные счета/"
"счета-фактуры."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:18
msgid ":doc:`Internal transfers <bank/internal_transfers>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Внутренние переводы <bank/internal_transfers>`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:19
msgid ""
"`Odoo Tutorials: Bank Configuration <https://www.odoo.com/slides/slide/bank-"
"configuration-6832>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Odoo Tutorials: Bank Configuration <https://www.odoo.com/slides/slide/bank-"
"configuration-6832>`_"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:25
#: ../../content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:290
#: ../../content/applications/finance/payment_providers/nuvei.rst:51
msgid "Payment methods"
msgstr "Методы оплаты"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:27
msgid ""
"Several payment methods are available in Odoo to allow different "
"configurations for different types of payments. Payment methods include "
"manual payments (such as cash), :doc:`checks <payments/pay_checks>`, and "
"batch payment files (such as :ref:`NACHA <l10n_us/ach-electronic-transfers>` "
"and :doc:`SEPA <payments/sepa_payments>`). Payment methods can be configured "
"in the :guilabel:`Incoming Payments` and :guilabel:`Outgoing Payments` tabs "
"of a bank or cash journal."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:35
msgid ":doc:`../../sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods` for Point of Sale"
msgstr ":doc:`../../sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods` для POS"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:40
msgid "Preferred payment method"
msgstr "Предпочитаемый способ оплаты"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:42
msgid ""
"A preferred payment method can be defined on a contact so that it is "
"automatically selected when a payment is created for that contact. From the "
"search bar, invoices and bills can be grouped by :guilabel:`Payment Method` "
"to simplify :ref:`group <accounting/payments/group-payments>` payments."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:46
msgid ""
"To set a preferred :guilabel:`Payment Method` for a customer or a vendor, go "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --> Customers` "
"or :menuselection:`Accounting --> Vendors --> Vendors` and select the "
"customer or vendor. In the :guilabel:`Sales & Purchase` tab of the contact "
"form, select the preferred :guilabel:`Payment Method` in "
"the :guilabel:`Sales` section for invoice payments or in "
"the :guilabel:`Purchase` section for vendor bill payments."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:53
msgid ""
"Access a full list of all contacts from the :guilabel:`Customers` "
"or :guilabel:`Vendors` list view by removing the :guilabel:`Customers` "
"or :guilabel:`Vendors` filter. Alternatively, access the full contact list "
"through the Contacts app."
msgstr ""
"Получить доступ к полному списку всех контактов можно из представления "
"списка :guilabel:`Клиенты` или :guilabel:`Поставщики`, удалив "
"фильтр :guilabel:`Клиенты` или :guilabel:`Поставщики`. Также можно получить "
"доступ к полному списку контактов через приложение Контакты."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:60
msgid "Checks"
msgstr "Чеки"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:62
msgid ""
":doc:`Vendor bills can be paid by check <payments/pay_checks>` using a "
"dedicated outgoing payment method, which allows check numbers to be tracked "
"and checks to be printed directly from Odoo."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Векселя поставщиков можно оплачивать чеком <payments/pay_checks>`, "
"используя специальный способ исходящего платежа, который позволяет "
"отслеживать номера чеков и печатать чеки непосредственно из Odoo."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:65
msgid ""
"For incoming customer check payments, you can use the "
"default :guilabel:`Manual Payment` payment method, or you can create a "
"payment method specifically for checks to help identify such payments "
"quickly. To create a *Check* payment method, follow these steps:"
msgstr ""
"Для входящих платежей клиентов чеками можно использовать способ оплаты по "
"умолчанию :guilabel:`Ручной платёж`, или можно создать способ оплаты "
"специально для чеков, чтобы быстрее идентифицировать такие платежи. Чтобы "
"создать способ оплаты *Чек*, выполните следующие действия:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:69
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Journals` and select "
"the :guilabel:`Bank` journal."
msgstr ""
"Перейдите в :menuselection:`Бухгалтерский учёт --> Настройка --> Журналы` и "
"выберите журнал :guilabel:`Банк`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:71
msgid "In the :guilabel:`Incoming Payments` tab, click :guilabel:`Add a line`."
msgstr ""
"На вкладке :guilabel:`Входящие платежи` нажмите :guilabel:`Добавить строку`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:72
msgid ""
"As :guilabel:`Payment Method`, select :guilabel:`Manual`, then enter `Check` "
"as the :guilabel:`Name`."
msgstr ""
"В качестве :guilabel:`Способа оплаты` выберите :guilabel:`Вручную`, затем "
"введите `Чек` в качестве :guilabel:`Названия`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:75
msgid ""
"When registering a customer payment :ref:`on an invoice <accounting/payments/"
"from-invoice-bill>` or :ref:`not related to an invoice <accounting/payments/"
"not-tied>`, use the new :guilabel:`Check` payment method."
msgstr ""
"При регистрации платежа клиента :ref:`по счёту <accounting/payments/from-"
"invoice-bill>` или :ref:`не связанного со счётом <accounting/payments/not-"
"tied>` используйте новый способ оплаты :guilabel:`Чек`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:80
msgid ""
"Registering a customer payment by check in Odoo does not move funds. Checks "
"must be deposited in order to make the payment. Once deposited to your bank, "
"the check should appear as a :doc:`bank transaction <bank/transactions>`, at "
"which point it can be :doc:`reconciled <bank/reconciliation>` with the "
"registered payment."
msgstr ""
"Регистрация платежа клиента чеком в Odoo не перемещает средства. Чеки "
"необходимо депонировать, чтобы осуществить платёж. После внесения в ваш банк "
"чек должен появиться как :doc:`банковская транзакция <bank/transactions>`, "
"после чего его можно :doc:`сверить <bank/reconciliation>` с "
"зарегистрированным платежом."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:86
msgid ""
"For best practice, enter the check number as the :guilabel:`Memo` when "
"registering a customer payment by check."
msgstr ""
"Рекомендуется вводить номер чека в поле :guilabel:`Заметка` при регистрации "
"платежа клиента чеком."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:88
msgid ""
":doc:`Batch payments <payments/batch>` can simplify reconciling deposits "
"containing multiple checks."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Пакетные платежи <payments/batch>` могут упростить сверку депозитов, "
"содержащих несколько чеков."

