#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:900
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`EDI VAT` window, make sure a valid VAT :guilabel:`ROF` "
"(Référence d’Obligation Fiscale) is entered."
msgstr ""
"В окне :guilabel:`EDI НДС` убедитесь, что введён "
"действительный :guilabel:`ROF` (Référence d'Obligation Fiscale) для НДС."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:902
msgid ""
"If needed, enable the :guilabel:`Add express mention` option and include a "
