msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Add a line` in the :guilabel:`IBAN` column to enter an IBAN "
"account number and BIC for the payment."
msgstr ""
"Нажмите :guilabel:`Добавить строку` в столбце :guilabel:`IBAN`, чтобы ввести "
