msgstr "`l10n_jo`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/jordan.rst:21
msgid ""
"Jordanian :ref:`fiscal localization package <fiscal_localizations/"
"packages>`, complete with the Jordanian chart of accounts, taxes, tax "
