msgstr "Перейдите в :menuselection:`Settings` в левом меню."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/payment_providers/paymob.rst:25
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Account Info` section, copy the value of "
"the :guilabel:`HMAC` field and save it for :ref:`later <payment_providers/"
"paymob/configure_odoo>`."
msgstr ""
"В разделе :guilabel:`Account Info` скопируйте значение поля :guilabel:`HMAC` "
"и сохраните его для :ref:`дальнейшего использования <payment_providers/"
"paymob/configure_odoo>`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/payment_providers/paymob.rst:27
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`View` next to the :guilabel:`API Key`, :guilabel:`Secret "
"Key`, and :guilabel:`Public Key` fields to reveal each value. Copy each key "
"and save it for :ref:`later <payment_providers/paymob/configure_odoo>`."
msgstr ""
"Нажмите :guilabel:`View` рядом с полями :guilabel:`API "
"Key`, :guilabel:`Secret Key` и :guilabel:`Public Key`, чтобы отобразить "
"каждое значение. Скопируйте каждый ключ и сохраните его "
"для :ref:`дальнейшего использования <payment_providers/paymob/"
"configure_odoo>`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/payment_providers/paymob.rst:30
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Developers --> Payment Integrations` in the left "
"menu."
msgstr ""
"Перейдите в :menuselection:`Developers --> Payment Integrations` в левом "
"меню."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/payment_providers/paymob.rst:31
msgid ""
"Ensure that all required payment methods are listed in the payment "
"integrations. If any payment method is missing, contact Paymob support."
msgstr ""
"Убедитесь, что все необходимые способы оплаты перечислены в интеграциях "
