"step :ref:`payment_providers/paymob/configure_dashboard`."
msgstr ""
"Заполните поля :guilabel:`HMAC Key`, :guilabel:`API key`, :guilabel:`Secret "
"Key` и :guilabel:`Public Key` информацией, сохранённой на "
"этапе :ref:`payment_providers/paymob/configure_dashboard`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/payment_providers/paymob.rst:47
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Configuration` tab, click :guilabel:`Enable Payment "
"Methods`, then :ref:`activate the payment methods <payment_providers/"
"payment_methods>` you want to offer."
msgstr ""
"На вкладке :guilabel:`Configuration` нажмите :guilabel:`Enable Payment "
"Methods`, затем :ref:`активируйте способы оплаты <payment_providers/"
